<title>POLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS POOL B RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS POOL B RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>World championship pool B ice hockey results on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    Belarus     4   Kazakhstan    3    (0-0 2-1 2-2)</p>
<p>Belarus - Andrei Skabelka 31, 44, Alexandre Andrievski 35, Oleg Romanov 47.</p>
<p>Kazakhstan - Yerlan Sagymbayev 23, 53, Vladimir Antipin 58.</p>
<p>    Austria     3   Denmark	 1    (1-0 1-0 1-1)</p>
<p>Austria - Richard Nasheim 7, Gerhard Puschnik 32, Manfred Muehr 55.</p>
<p>Denmark - Jens Christian Nielsen 51</p>
<p>    Switzerland  0   Poland	  0</p>
